      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Note: Reference Video + Custom Audio",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 — Reference Video + Custom Audio\n\nThis native Ref2VA workflow generates a new video-and-audio clip from a reference video and a separately uploaded audio reference. It does not copy either source frame-for-frame.\n\nUse `<Video 1>` for the reference video and `<Audio 1>` for the custom audio. Reference tags are one-based and must match the connected media order.\n\nUpload a **24-fps, 2–15 second reference video**. `GetVideoComponents` sends only its frames to `ref_videos.ref_video_0`; any soundtrack embedded in that video is intentionally ignored. Upload the independent audio file with `LoadAudio`. `TrimAudioDuration` selects the portion used by `ref_audios.ref_audio_0`, and its duration follows the workflow's Duration control.\n\nThe bundled SageAttention patch is already wired between the model loader and sampler. It safely falls back to ComfyUI's normal attention when a compatible SageAttention library is unavailable. The graph uses stock `res_multistep` sampling and does not use the legacy Direct loaders or Dual Sigma sampler.\n\nRequires ComfyUI 0.30.1 or newer."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
